            <ArticleTitle>Regional versus general anaesthesia for improved cognitive function after procedures other than cardiac surgery or neurosurgery in adult and paediatric patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">CD008737</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is the protocol for a review and there is no abstract. The objectives are as follows: The objective of this review is to compare the effects of regional versus general anaesthesia on cognitive function after procedures other than cardiac surgery or neurosurgery in adult and in paediatric patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
